// # Advanced Transformer & LLM Acceleration Fail-Closed Stubs
//
// Logline: Enforces fail-closed security and execution barriers for un-accelerated FlashAttention, Triton, CUTLASS, vLLM PagedAttention, and NF4 CUDA kernels.
//
// Setup: Stubs with fail-closed process_exit(1) execution traps for native accelerator backends.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Trap CUDA and Triton FlashAttention-2 forward and backward accelerated kernel invocations.
//   2. Trap vLLM PagedAttention GPU memory management and bitsandbytes NF4 CUDA dequantizers.
//   3. Trap Apple Metal and cuDNN Whisper audio convolutions and CLIP FP8 tensor core operations.

/// Accelerated CUDA FlashAttention-2 forward kernel launch.
/// COMPILER LIMITATION: openOODA compiler lacks native CUDA FlashAttention PTX backend.
pub fn deep_ai_gpu_flash_attn_fwd_stub(cap: &SysCap) {
    // COMPILER LIMITATION: No native FlashAttention CUDA kernel available.
    process_exit(1);
}

